# Docs and tracking

- Update task Status/Owner/Updated when claiming or finishing work
- Append HANDOFF entries (newest at bottom); never delete others' entries
- Reviewer updates STATUS.md + CHANGELOG.md when marking DONE
- Behavior/arch/protocol changes update the matching `docs/0*.md` and ADRs if needed
- Protocol changes bump `PROTOCOL_VERSION` and update `docs/02_PROTOCOL.md`
- OPEN QUESTIONS go under that heading in HANDOFF — pick reversible defaults and continue
